    275	
    276	## 7. Environment variables (names only)
    277	
    278	| Name | Used by | Purpose |
    279	|---|---|---|
    280	| `DOCS_DIR` | backend | Documents folder |
    281	| `LLM_PROXY_URL` | backend | Enables proxy mode; API base address |
    282	| `LLM_PROXY_API_KEY` | backend | Optional bearer key |
    283	| `LLM_PROXY_MODEL` | backend | Model name; required in proxy mode |
    284	| `BACKEND_URL` | frontend server | FastAPI base address |
    285	| `NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED` | `test.sh` | Turns off Next.js telemetry |
    286	
    287	The backend does not load `.env` files. Never commit secrets; `.gitignore` also
    288	lists `.env*`.
    289	
    290	## 8. Test plan
    291	
    292	No test may reach an external network or a real LLM. Only loopback
    293	(`127.0.0.1`) connections are allowed. Tests must not depend on the contents of
    294	`data/`; use fixtures or temporary folders.
    295	
    296	### 8.1 Backend unit tests (pytest)
    297	
    298	- **Retrieval:** file type filtering and ordering; heading joining; long-chunk
    299	  splitting; stopwords and punctuation; the relevant chunk ranks first; at most
    300	  3 results; deterministic tie order; empty list for no match, stopword-only
    301	  question and empty folder; startup errors for a missing folder and bad UTF-8.
    302	- **LLM:** exact stub text; proxy request URL, headers, model and messages;
    303	  no auth header without a key; each failure case raises the LLM error; mode
    304	  selection; missing model fails startup. Use `httpx.MockTransport`.
    305	- **API** (`TestClient`): health count; successful ask and response shape; 422
    306	  for blank and over-long questions; no-match answer without calling the LLM;
    307	  502 on LLM error without leaking the key or upstream body.
